{"unit_id":"Ote65__dsh-session-bridge#card-zh","repo":"Ote65/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"72d64af8781c3ffd041d0ff71f46c2b51193cf21","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bridge 是一个 DSH 网页客户端插件：在会话侧边栏菜单加入暴露入口，并启动本机 HTTP 桥。它可复制交接提示词、查看会话状态与增量记录、呈现待回答问题，并支持提交选项答案和执行斜杠命令。适合把 DSH 会话交给 Codex、Trae 等外部 Agent 查看或继续处理。需要 Node.js 运行环境，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:22","lib/client.js:302","lib/index.js:375","lib/index.js:480"]}
{"unit_id":"Ote65__dsh-session-bridge#card-en","repo":"Ote65/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"72d64af8781c3ffd041d0ff71f46c2b51193cf21","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-bridge adds a session menu action to DSH and serves a local HTTP bridge. An external agent can read session status and transcript events, inspect pending questions, submit answers, and run slash commands. Use it to hand a session to another agent. Requires Node.js; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:22","lib/client.js:302","lib/index.js:375","lib/index.js:480"]}
